                                                "sense_id": "a4857956-83bf-3b2e-9f90-2d5020692562",
                                                "text": "A trailing plant with flowers like small white stars had bound itself across the bows as if in reverence for the fallen king, and in the crevices of his stony hair yellow stonecrop gleamed."
